# Source video masters (45 MB). They are NOT part of the repository: the
# deliverables in public/videos/ are encoded from them by
# `node scripts/video-chapters.mjs`. The contents are ignored, the directory
# keeps its README — a git-ignored directory cannot be re-included, so the
# pattern must stay on the contents and not on the directory itself.
assets/masters/*
!assets/masters/README.md
/*.mp4
